      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 9,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Wan Animate + Video Director + official relighting LoRA\n\nWhat this workflow does:\n1. Uses Video Director with model_type = wan22_animate.\n2. Patches the Wan Animate checkpoint with the official relight LoRA at 1.0.\n3. Also patches the model with the light2xv / step-distill LoRA at 1.0, because the Director profile expects the matching LoRA stack.\n4. CLIP Vision is connected so I2V / replacement style workflows have the extra conditioning available.\n\nImportant:\n- Use this for character replacement / animation.\n- The official Wan Animate page says not to use LoRAs trained on normal Wan2.2 with Wan Animate.\n- This workflow therefore uses the Wan Animate-specific relighting LoRA, not Instareal.\n\nTimeline notes:\n- timeline_json starts as {}. Open the Video Director timeline UI and add your clips / media there.\n- If you use source-video replacement mode, set that up from the Director timeline / clip media, not from external LoadVideo nodes here.\n"
      ],
      "title": "README — Wan Animate + Director"
    }
